            "Value List": NaN,
            "Core": "Cond",
            "CDISC Notes": "DEVRPDT indicates date when device was repositioned. DEVRPDT is required when a device could be repositioned and included in analysis. \\n Note that some devices may be repositioned multiple times. If there are records in SDTM for each occurrence of the device being repositioned, either \\n * collapse into 1 record in ADDL, where the algorithm for deriving DEVRPDT is defined in the SAP; or \\n * use DEVRPyDT. \\n The analysis needs specified in the SAP determine whether to include a single collapsed date or a set of dates."
        },
        {
