            "Type": "Num",
            "CDISC CT Codelist Code(s)": NaN,
            "CDISC CT Codelist Submission Value(s)": NaN,
            "Described Value Domain(s)": NaN,
            "Value List": NaN,
            "Core": "Cond",
            "CDISC Notes": "DEVMDDT indicates date when device was modified for a subject in a study. The device modification or maintenance could be done surgically or externally depending on device. What would qualify as device modification is defined by study protocol and SAP. DEVMDDT is required when the device could be modified and included in analysis. \\n Note that some devices may be modified multiple times. If there are records in SDTM for each occurrence of the device being modified, either \\n * collapse into 1 record in ADDL, where the algorithm for deriving DEVMDDT is defined in the SAP; or \\n * use DEVMDyDT. \\n The analysis needs specified in the SAP determine whether to include a single collapsed date or a set of dates."
        },
